global stanna

on mouseDown
  [  0] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [  3] setlocal 0 .............................. Knapp = 9
  [  5] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  7] thebuiltin 7 ............................ <the mouseDown>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 61] ............................ repeat while the mouseDown
  [ 12] getlocal 0 .............................. <Knapp>
  [ 14] pusharglist 1 ........................... <Knapp>
  [ 16] extcall 2 ............................... <rollOver(Knapp)>
  [ 18] jmpifz [ 39] ............................ if rollOver(Knapp) then / else
  [ 21] getlocal 0 .............................. <Knapp>
  [ 23] pushcons 0 .............................. <"nickfram">
  [ 25] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 26] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 29] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "nickfram">
  [ 31] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 34] set 6 ................................... set the castNum of sprite Knapp to the number of member "nickfram"
  [ 36] jmp [ 54]
  [ 39] getlocal 0 .............................. <Knapp>
  [ 41] pushcons 8 .............................. <"fram\x8Ct">
  [ 43] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 44] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 47] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "fram\x8Ct">
  [ 49] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 52] set 6 ................................... set the castNum of sprite Knapp to the number of member "fram\x8Ct"
  [ 54] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 56] extcall 6 ............................... updateStage()
  [ 58] endrepeat [  5]
  [ 61] getlocal 0 .............................. <Knapp>
  [ 63] pusharglist 1 ........................... <Knapp>
  [ 65] extcall 2 ............................... <rollOver(Knapp)>
  [ 67] not ..................................... <not rollOver(Knapp)>
  [ 68] jmpifz [ 72] ............................ if not rollOver(Knapp) then
  [ 71] ret ..................................... exit
  [ 72] pushsymb 15 ............................. <#next>
  [ 74] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <#next>
  [ 76] extcall 9 ............................... go(#next)
  [ 78] ret
end
